  "id": "arts-and-crafts",
  "term": "arts and crafts",
  "definition": "Arts and crafts refers to a child’s participation in creative making activities at home, treated here as one kind of home experience. In this study, more frequent participation in arts and crafts was linked with better executive function performance, especially visual-spatial working memory.",
